<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Divine Diurganate -->
  <DD_DivineDiurganate_Faction.label>双尾教国</DD_DivineDiurganate_Faction.label>
  <!-- EN: The Twin-Tailed Kingdom — also known as Divine Diurganate — is a theocratic ratkin kingdom founded by followers of the Holy Twin-Tail. While the nation has industrialized, its social structure remains largely religious, resulting in a landscape of billowing diesel mechs, spark-splattering factories, and ubiquitous shrines and icons. \n\nCompared to other industrialized ratkin kingdoms, the Divine Diurganate is far ahead. The Catholic Church has spearheaded the development of a series of large-scale equipment, mechs, and aircraft powered by diesel and internal combustion engines, establishing a technological advantage over other ratkin kingdoms. Due to religious fanaticism, the ratkins of this kingdom are not as peaceful and docile as their counterparts. They possess a tradition of extreme xenophobia and hostility towards other races and are obsessed with outward expansion and the assimilation of other ratkins. -->
  <DD_DivineDiurganate_Faction.description>双尾教国——也称狄尔格内特——是由圣双尾鼠的信徒们建立的一个政教合一的鼠族王国。这个国家已经迈入工业化，但是社会结构整体上还是围绕宗教构建的，因此喷着滚滚黑烟的柴油机甲、进溅着火星的工厂和无处不在的神龛圣像共同构成了这个国家的街景。\n\n相较于其他迈入工业化的鼠族王国，双尾教国在这条道路上反而遥遥领先。教廷主导开发了一系列以柴油和内燃机驱动的大型设备、机甲、飞行器，以此建立对其他鼠族王国的科技优势。\n\n因为宗教狂热，这个国家的鼠族并不像她们的同类那样和平温顺，她们的国度内有着极度仇外和敌视异族的传统，并且醉心于向外扩张和教化其他的鼠族。</DD_DivineDiurganate_Faction.description>
  <!-- EN: Divine Diurganate -->
  <DD_DivineDiurganate_Faction.fixedName>双尾教国</DD_DivineDiurganate_Faction.fixedName>
  <!-- EN: pontiff -->
  <DD_DivineDiurganate_Faction.leaderTitle>教皇</DD_DivineDiurganate_Faction.leaderTitle>
